{
  "about": [
    "The sample records shown in the mockups (docs/mockups/), saved so the app can be built to match them. crm/sample_data.py turns these offsets into dates on the day the data is made, and adds what this file leaves out.",
    "Made from the mockups dated Mon Nov 16, 2026. On that date these records give the mockups' figures: open pipeline $9,040,000 across 17 deals, expected revenue $3,481,000, won this month $1,080,000 from 2 deals, won in the last 12 months $7,710,000 from 16 deals, 3 deals late."
  ],
  "dates": {
    "daysFromToday": "That many days after today, or before it when negative.",
    "monthsAgoAndDay": "For won deals: that day of the month, monthsAgo calendar months before the current month. A day past the end of a short month becomes its last day, and a date after today becomes today. This keeps the right wins in each month on any date, including the 1st and the 31st.",
    "time": "Local time of day, 24-hour. An entry dated today whose time is still to come is moved to a few minutes before the data is made, so recent activity never shows the future.",
    "onCloseDate": "The stage change happens on the deal's close date, since moving a deal to Won or Lost sets its close date."
  },
  "boardOrder": "Deals are listed in board order within each stage: the first open deal at a stage is the top card in its column. Won and Lost are newest first.",
  "stillToAdd": [
    "About 21 more contacts, two to four per organization, so there are about 36, with Lead, Qualified and Customer all well represented. Each contact needs a status, job title, email under a made-up company domain ending in .example.com, and phone.",
    "Each organization needs an industry (at least six across the twelve), a website and notes.",
    "Stage history for every deal past New, between its start and today or its close, matching furthestStage, including the stage changes listed under recentActivity.",
    "About 120 activities over the last 12 months, including the ones listed here, linked to a contact, a deal or both.",
    "Each follow-up below needs its activity type and when it was logged. Add 4 more follow-ups due later than 7 days from today, and some marked done."
  ],
